  /// tandem with the data source parameters when you copy a data source by
  /// using a create or update request. The API operation compares the
  /// DataSourceParameters structure that's in the request with the structures
  /// in the AlternateDataSourceParameters allow list. If the structures are
  /// an exact match, the request is allowed to use the credentials from this
  /// existing data source. If the AlternateDataSourceParameters list is null,
  /// the Credentials originally used with this DataSourceParameters are
