  /// DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_SMALL : Small cross-diagonal stripes pattern.
  /// DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_MEDIUM : Medium cross-diagonal stripes pattern.
  /// DIAGONAL_OPPOSITE_LARGE : Large cross-diagonal stripes pattern.
  /// CIRCLE_SMALL : Small circle pattern. CIRCLE_MEDIUM : Medium circle
  /// pattern. CIRCLE_LARGE : Large circle pattern. DIAMOND_SMALL : Small
  /// diamonds pattern. DIAMOND_MEDIUM : Medium diamonds pattern.
  /// DIAMOND_LARGE : Large diamonds pattern. DIAMOND_GRID_SMALL : Small
  /// diamond grid pattern. DIAMOND_GRID_MEDIUM : Medium diamond grid pattern.
  /// DIAMOND_GRID_LARGE : Large diamond grid pattern. CHECKERBOARD_SMALL :
